@startuml 发布社区内容顺序图
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxmessagesize 80
skinparam participantBackgroundColor white
skinparam actorBackgroundColor white
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor white
skinparam defaultWidth 400
skinparam sequenceArrowColor Black
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam ParticipantPadding 40



actor "买家" as Buyer
participant "Discussions.vue" as Frontend
participant "DiscussionController" as Controller
participant "数据库" as Database

Buyer -> Frontend++: 点击"发布内容",填写标题和正文
Frontend -> Controller++: POST /api/discussions
Controller -> Controller: 从JWT认证中获取买家ID
Controller -> Database++: INSERT INTO discussions
Database --> Controller--: 返回内容ID
Controller -> Database++: INSERT INTO discussion_products(服装关联)
Database --> Controller--: 返回插入结果
Controller -> Database++: INSERT INTO discussion_images(图片关联)
Database --> Controller--: 返回插入结果
Controller --> Frontend--: 返回创建成功(内容ID)
Frontend --> Buyer--: 显示发布成功提示


@enduml
